+# Native own-history need association: reconstruction V2
+
+This is a protected, opt-in CPU port on a fresh N2048 host. It is not a
+replacement default brain, an Adam training result, GPU parity, or evidence of
+learned policy competence. Its 512-cell arithmetic workspace is auxiliary
+scratch, not the creature's brain size. N2048 uses the already supported canonical
+fresh-host foundation path. No Nano512 foundation compatibility is inferred.
+
+## Recovery status
+
+The original environment was lost at the launch command. The exec server failed
+before creating a process. Status is `launch_failed_before_process`, with zero
+native world steps and no confirmed marker or life output. The prior source
+package was never uploaded. Its identities survive in the conversation, but its
+files and build output are unavailable:
+
+- Source input root: d2667b82d75a886d3e02c277636ff10d86782a19d1bf11defec7f96ce3fa0f1f.
+- Source-only patch: 9085f47749b0516d202a61c30acb881d810eb9c3b7b6a96f980c19841b94627c.
+- Frozen plan: b042680f95d6b881d936bb579795c540692c3cff97d5d1cddff94d92d7c58145.
+- Inherited asset: 1d2978cbd857a7ca99dc1b2cf65be9f6ff417a6f78199282e0431b94332c9377.
+
+V2 reconstructs the authored source on accepted main c775c8c92e8f5e625f8a3e861ef79200199b54df,
+tree da127f8d53fd615f3df18e01a5cbff8c2232738c. It does not claim byte-exact
+recovery. Fresh qualification is required. The only intentional semantic change
+is a diagnostic correction: future or expired sources now report their age
+rejection instead of potentially returning missing support with an empty reason
+list. Retrieval eligibility, genes, seed, physiological domain and exposure
+budget do not change. This is not an empirical rescue: no life had begun.
+
+The original preflight caught and corrected setup failures before exposure:
+source-unit setup initially omitted the N2048 brain class; an empty trainer mask
+was invalid; adding the peer after host roster admission was rejected. The valid
+fixture uses a nonempty inert mask and creates the peer before host admission.
+No optimizer update occurs. These failures must not be counted as life results.
+
+## Implemented protected boundary
+
+`enable_need_association_port` accepts only an unexecuted fresh host. The recipe,
+execution identity and acquired association state enter a separate private-seal
+domain. Ordinary hosts retain the original private-seal tuple and checkpoint
+format. The distinct step output omits legacy replay ticks and private neural
+banks. Enabled sessions reject ordinary step and legacy checkpoint/export paths.
+There is no dedicated cold-restore format yet, and no PPO/backward or GPU
+admission. No retention or deployment claim is made.
+
+Only the canonical CPU host writes acquired records, after actual neural
+selection, physical execution and final cognitive charging. Admission requires
+the selected representative's own exact completed physical receipt. Other
+channels must be genuine exact benign no-ops. Blocked or tiny movement is not a
+no-op. Full raw biology, including ambient contact and shared drift, remains in
+the measured vector. This is predictive context association, not isolated credit.
+
+Observed Inspect uses the real tracked target and entity. Targetless Rest and
+Idle/NoPosture use a separate own-body SelfAction namespace, never an invented
+object. The store retains before, after, raw delta, source sequence/frame,
+physical receipt, outcome tick and confidence. Capacity is 32 records. The V1
+acquired-store contract is not weakened or reinterpreted.
+
+The stationary association domain binds action, target, body pose and velocity,
+observed slots/geometry, phenotype, embodiment calibration, ordinary sensory
+channels, and expressed developmental/sensor/effector context. Clock fields are
+excluded from stable identity, but their provenance remains. Drives, hormones,
+and body/organ energy may vary by at most 0.125 from the observed source, for at
+most 16 ticks. Injury, health, thermal stress, sleep, organ damage/integrity and
+developmental expression remain exact. This is a bounded local hypothesis, not
+learned generalized dynamics. Conservative gates may prevent natural recall.
+
+## Real native comparison
+
+Both separately acquired raw transitions produce clamped successors at the
+current 11-axis state. Existing sparse projection and dendritic primitives
+compute reference-successor burden minus action-successor burden. Neither raw
+vector is replaced by an external-control drift subtraction. Missing action,
+missing reference, unsupported contexts or zero confidence fail closed through
+native support/confidence projection gates. Source confidence is combined as a
+product, not falsely reported as a minimum.
+
+The reference recipe keeps the original roles, knots [0, 0.25, 0.5, 0.75], basis
+[0.125, 0.25, 0.25, 0.25], seven magnitudes 1/7 and gain/ceiling at most 0.35.
+The explicit optional engineered normalization is `tanh(difference / 0.001)`.
+It is pressure-unit normalization, not an increase of the bounded gain gene.
+Identity normalization remains available.
+
+The previous raw-value scale proposal multiplied absolute utility by 2048.
+Although isolated social relief looked promising, all six complete physical
+Approach vectors had larger hunger/fatigue/ATP losses: approximately -0.00097937
+to -0.00106276 before scaling, reaching the -0.35 ceiling near confidence
+0.16–0.175. Those physical fixtures lacked a native selected neural envelope and
+were never acquired evidence. This rejected proposal and its full-vector result
+remain part of the record; the own-history comparison does not relabel them.
+
+## Work and historical qualification
+
+Before environment loss, 10 native circuit tests passed, including 4,224 exact
+full-scratch/active-coordinate pairs, bounds/duplicate/stale-zeroing checks,
+full-vector common-mode cancellation, positive relief, satiation, harm, unknown
+and zero-confidence controls. Eleven source/context tests and a fresh identity/
+legacy-export test also passed, with strict core and CPU Clippy. These are prior
+V1 results, not a substitute for V2 requalification.
+
+Actual prior arithmetic at loneliness 0.15 and relief 0.0075 was 0.045625158
+before confidence gates under quantum 0.001, versus 0.000045886267 under identity
+normalization. These were fixed circuit inputs, not life-learned outcomes.
+
+Full scratch executes 5,632 finalized cells, 128 COO edges, 19 tiles and 88
+branches plus 88 inputs per row. With two lookup operations its policy debit was
+738 Q16 ATP. The separately identified active-coordinate implementation executes
+85 finalized cells, 118 prior-state copies, 85 accumulator clears and 66 stale
+cell clears, with the same edges, tiles and dendrites. Its debit was 45 Q16.
+It still initializes 1,536 scratch floats and reports coordinate checks and
+allocation separately. Eleven scratch stages mean zero extra recurrent or
+biological microsteps. Shared context construction is amortized per decision;
+shared reference-basis execution has not been implemented.
+
+Executed lookup, reader and final mix work is included for Unknown and zero-gain
+rows too. ATP affordability uses the existing native policy. Final cognitive
+charging counts dendrites and the typed final mix once, and measured source
+after-physiology includes that charge. No padded-work discount or free control
+is introduced.
+
+## Frozen admission fixture
+
+Study identity is `need-association-admission-v1`; source revision is
+`reconstruction-v2`. Construction, world and sampling seed stay 2026111301.
+The same frozen inherited asset hash is asserted before exposure. Initial scene:
+one fresh N2048 ObjectSlots host, one harmless static peer 0.2 metres in positive
+X, scenery removed and ecology disabled before host admission. After start there
+are no edits, replenishment, resets, forced selections or candidate masks.
+Movement and manipulation remain ordinary offered/sampled choices.
+
+The inherited ActionCandidate coefficients are prospectively fixed: Rest lane
+23 totals 8, Inspect contact lane 18 totals 8, Approach lane 23 totals 6, Contact
+lane 23 totals 6; all other ActionCandidate coordinates are zero. Aggregate
+coefficients are divided among duplicate coordinates. Other genes, recurrent
+circuitry, biology and plasticity are unchanged. This engineered stationary
+prior helps source reachability; it is not a learned policy or a host score.
+
+Reference is own Rest history. Execution is ActiveCoordinates, pressure quantum
+0.001, gain/cap 0.35 and sampling temperature 1.0. Maximum is 12 native decisions.
+Health below 0.98, body energy below 0.65, sleeping/no decision or any host error
+ends the fixture. A create-new no-retry marker precedes the first native step.
+No failed/null life is replaced, extended or retuned. The prior preflight showed
+12 candidates and four reader rows, extra ATP 178 Q16, ordinary 1,774 Q16 and
+49,151 Q16 available; this must be freshly verified on V2.
+
+The nonvacuity check requires actual stored SelfAction and observed Inspect
+sources followed by naturally reached paired observed-action/reference support.
+Rest matching itself is insufficient. The fixture tests authentic admission and
+recall reachability, not policy competence. A later policy comparison, if
+justified, must have its own frozen matched fresh seeds, explicit work-matched
+reader/source/reference controls, and no post-start gene or horizon tuning.
+
+All runtime journals and any fresh private data remain local and out of source
+publication. Publish only source, plan, hashes, validation status and separately
+reviewed sanitized summaries.
